# The multibody model: with the frame free (no feet) and frictionless
# guides, the motors' forces are internal, so the machine's total momentum
# stays zero while the moving parts go one way and the frame the other.
@program portal/portal_sim
@args portal/machine/portal.portal
frame 600 200 0 0 0 0
guidey 0 0
guidex 0 0
run 0.05
lcnc 1
run 0.2
mark
# 0.6 s a move: at 0.5 s the second one tripped a drive's position error (on
# the portal branch too, unseen: the carriage coasted on; DEBUGNOTES)
move 0.6 800 800
print mom_x mom_y frame_x frame_y
move 0.6 200 200
print mom_x mom_y frame_x frame_y fault
@expect max|portal.mom_x| < 1e-3
@expect max|portal.mom_y| < 1e-3
@expect portal.frame_y[1] < -10000
@expect portal.frame_x[1] < -2000
@expect portal.frame_y[2] > 10000
@expect portal.fault == 0
@reject ^ERROR
